WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:08.180
This video shows how a teacher enters exam marks on a phone. The marks are typed on one card for each student.

00:00:09.855 --> 00:00:15.567
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Academics, and then choose Marks Entry.

00:00:17.136 --> 00:00:27.912
Choose the class, the exam type, the exam and the subject, one after the other. Under the subject, the page shows the total marks and the passing marks.

00:00:30.304 --> 00:00:39.592
The students of the class load by themselves, one card each, with a Marks field and an Absent box. Here there are four students.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:49.896
Tap each Marks field and type the marks. The most a student can get is the subject's total, here 100, and marks above it are not saved.

00:01:02.168 --> 00:01:11.744
Tap Save All Marks. A message confirms that the marks are saved. You can come back and edit them until the results are announced.

00:01:21.299 --> 00:01:23.483
The marks are saved.
